meta {
  name: Get a zone’s advisor findings
  type: http
  seq: 39
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/dns-zones/:dnsZone_id/advisor
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dnsZone_id: 
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Findings about the zone’s stored records, such as missing or weak email protection, with the snapshot those findings were judged from. `dmarc_weakened` says the zone’s DMARC policy was made weaker in the last 30 days (`weakened`: `reject` to `quarantine` or `none`; `lostReporting`: its `rua=` reporting address removed), with the record before and after in `values` and the change in `change` (`from`, `to`, `at`, `by`, `source`). Changes nothing.

  Scope: `dns.read`
}
